# Lab 03 — What RAG Is Made Of

This repository contains my solution for Lab 03 — What RAG Is Made Of.

## Description

In this laboratory work, I built the four pieces of a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) system by hand on four short policy articles from a fictional bank.

The lab includes:

- Chunking: article-level vs sentence-level
- Embedding with `intfloat/multilingual-e5-small`
- Retrieval with cosine similarity (literal and paraphrase queries)
- Generation with `Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct`, without and with retrieved context
- Optional: recall@1 comparison of the two chunking strategies

## Models

- Embedding: `intfloat/multilingual-e5-small`
- Generation: `Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct`

